/*
 * STM32_ACU_wiring_test_cube_v1_0.c
 *
 * Target: STM32F401VETx
 * Toolchain: STM32CubeIDE, project generated by STM32CubeMX
 *
 * Replace Core/Src/main.c with this file.
 *
 * Proteus bench architecture in this version:
 *   - STM32F401VE is the ACU master
 *   - SensorHub ATmega emulates IMU, HighG_L/R and KP200_L/R
 *   - Actuator hub ATmega currently used only as a Squib output stage
 *
 * Design intent:
 *   - keep all buses software-driven on STM32 for Proteus robustness
 *   - keep the firmware as one-file scaffolding that already contains
 *     self-test, monitoring and ACU decision logic
 *   - leave room for later extraction into hal/drivers/algorithms modules
 */
